  <item>
    <title>Vol.27 金庸武侠漫谈丨他留给我一场盛大相聚，然后说了声江湖再见</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6688107fae8e21859ad24db9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6688107fae8e21859ad24db9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2024 15:25:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好欢迎收听女子英专生的日常！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近金庸武侠世界这一新的金庸翻拍剧播出，（虽然这部剧不值得推荐）我们决定趁这波热度做一期金庸武侠漫谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：看过15本金庸小说的刀刀、从小混迹金庸贴吧、黄蓉贴吧的冷月。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持人：言情资深读者柚子代表女频小说加入辩论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 从小看金庸，究竟对我有着怎样的影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a>（那些年冷月磕过的冷门cp）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 男频女频讨论丨为什么TA看不进去金庸武侠？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a>十级学者认证考核：分别看了多少本？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a>最喜欢哪一本金庸小说？</span></p><span></span><p><span>刀刀：天龙八部</span></p><span></span><p><span>冷月：笑傲江湖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a>最喜欢的金庸小说女性角色？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（男凝视角battle：金庸有没有塑造过大女主？）</span></p><span></span><p><span>刀刀：无</span></p><span></span><p><span>冷月：黄蓉 郭襄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a>（冷月为什么不喜欢小龙女！！！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a>金庸小说文学形式上的特色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a>起名怎么这样有底蕴呜呜呜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a>写情感好细腻啊！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">63:02</a>金庸写过的哪几句话，你特别喜欢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4422">73:42</a>小彩蛋1：遇到男面试官，女生提金庸有惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4529">75:29</a>小彩蛋2：刀刀写在金庸去世当天的那段话</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头结尾BGM：沧海一声笑</span></p>]]></description>
