  <item>
    <title>Vol.25 味蕾记忆丨这是我们在北京深圳上海以及老家的见面约饭list</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660fab4bc891c06e7367b887</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660fab4bc891c06e7367b887</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 07:42:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎收听女子英专生的日常！年后由于大家都在或明或暗地开展一些减肥行为，关于吃也成为了讨论最多的话题，所以今天干脆就来聊一聊吃什么怎么吃。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：城市美食活地图 · 左 / 不劳作就无须进食的修仙 · 柚 / 不让她做饭她跟你急的李大嘴 · 冷</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 提问！各位印象最深刻的一顿饭</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 在异国度过了聊到凌晨五点钟的21岁生日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 接机homie给点的一碗深夜豌杂面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 我和发小在喝酒烧烤局上背诵前赤壁赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> 很1881的亲友聚餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> 在火锅升腾的热气里不再纠结为什么要谈恋爱这件事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 乡愁食物</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 家里炒的土豆丝为什么可以这么香</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 左氏糖醋鸡蛋 贼香！ (打完这行字 本人立刻去煎了一个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 不爱喝我们县的羊肉汤？那我没法跟你相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 油泼扯面擀面皮裤带面 西安的面怎么煮都好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 请问你们有没有碗碗蛋糕</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 你们的Comfort food是什么</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 一口掼奶油一生幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 茶百道的豆乳玉麒麟治愈了我的压抑的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> 海边咖啡馆可以冲刷掉一身班气</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 下面我要推美食了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2129">35:29</a> 香港：深水埗的公和豆品厂真的很绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 我要为香港美食正名 可以试试华香园 &nbsp;Vision Bakery 沾仔记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 北京：一家小巷子里的网红店 蜗牛小馆的油焖鸡真的很绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 能在五道口韩餐大军中脱颖而出的逗丝都吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">40:22</a> 可以试试牛街 白记年糕的驴打滚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> 彭记铁锅肥肠 祝你肥肠快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> 宫门口馒头铺 更适合中国宝宝的欧包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> 深圳：惊为天泥！鸟鹏烧鸟居酒屋的蟹籽熔岩土豆泥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> 像从日剧中走出来的清平面包店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 白塔牛肉粿条汤/糖方圆糖水铺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a> 在上海爱上东北一条街</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 陵水酒家</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 你怎么对待做饭这件事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2955">49:15</a> 在做饭的过程中获得心流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3245">54:05</a> 我超认真准备了一顿饭 结果我爸说不好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3433">57:13</a> 我会把饭分为 「维持生命体征餐」和「啊 真幸福餐」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3461">57:41</a> 一些出于女性主义的潜意识反抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3730">01:02:10</a> 刷一周高效备餐的视频 本J人得到了极大满足</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3903">01:05:03</a> 大众点评的必吃榜 一定要去吃到才算来过吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4056">01:07:36</a> 我爱的是美食背后的人文 没有当地朋友也可以在小红书上找搭子</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家拥有更多和美食有关的美好回忆！！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luYuQkYgxZ4nRxDpgYxWrhZD0zvd.m4a" length="69555023" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1SmJEYno4XzZRY2plLWxSSW1WZF9lemdhMmsucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
