    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎收听女子英专生的日常。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是原本要录书影音，但聊得太high有限时间里只录了书的书籍推荐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是原本准备发在阳历年末，结果拖拖拖拖成了农历年末的年终盘点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>既然如此，那就先给大家拜个早年吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 柚子哭到头痛的《命运》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a>《寂寞的游戏》砸开水缸，发现是自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 《酉山节考》（电影）死亡与贫穷；死亡与活着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 关于死亡的写实记录《最好的告别》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 泪点很高的小胖看哭了！的《献给阿尔及侬的花束》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> 刀刀感动于人性之光的「近距离看美国」系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a> 跨文化系列推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">50:56</a> 冷月深夜哭着看完的《莫须有》QAQ</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：盘尼西林-梦在黎明破晓时</span></p>]]></description>
