  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 手账入坑指南：来！教你用手账变成J人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6548db2dde390991a4c3ec29</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6548db2dde390991a4c3ec29</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Nov 2023 12:25:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！这里是女子英专生的日常第19期内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>拖延了这么久没有更新，是因为前一段时间冷月三次元太过繁忙——换工作换城市，进行了一系列离职搬家入职的大动作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过终于和柚子在同一座城市生活，希望以后录制能够更加方便，我们的更新也可以更加频繁。（开始画一些美好的大饼</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的idea来自上一期聊得不够尽兴的柚子。因为上一期我们只聚焦在了日记，让她关于手账的分享欲无处释放，因此本期我们决定系统地聊聊手账这个深坑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾——多年手账er高高、因为手账成为J人的柚子。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 提问专业手账er：手账的定义和分类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 记录类手账：Pal</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 记录类手账：Hobo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 记录类手账：Kinbor</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 记录类手账：TN</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 记录类手账：ameame</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 记录类手账：poems for you</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 详细聊聊拼贴这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 效率类手账：国誉手账</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 效率类手账：Youthwill</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 效率类手账：Susie博主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1982">33:02</a> 效率类手账：平方studio</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2167">36:07</a> 效率类APP：flomo&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 效率类APP：飞书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a> 喜欢手帐博主：不是闷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2893">48:13</a> 喜欢手帐博主：芝士正浓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3151">52:31</a> 喜欢手帐博主：一些韩国博主、后姨妈、樱井安多芬、A星、cheyenne barton……（一些七嘴八舌的安利环节）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> 手账相关的书店/文具店推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3732">62:12</a> 手账相关的文具推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4033">67:13</a> 做手账，让我们的生活有了那些变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：曹政奭 - 아로하</span></p><span></span><p><span>细心的主播为有需要的听众朋友们提供了节目中提及的部分手账内页详情图：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4JCN0NTCek9GFti6nqOvBtERVj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（pal内页↑）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrMqUUzCpYOJccPMPmv8RfYYqh0k.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（hobo时间轴部分↑）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6mb_lt7qN4vq6rZTV578YttEv3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvyQ3HMnkBF_6BgyHxaAd6xap_4W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>(高高精美拼贴背后的男人——每一部爆款耽改们↑）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmT-cJ6ZpAl51NfBndh0p3xyMakq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（国誉内页↑）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnhu4zJjVyLNj4hpnqbG3TDQdEC-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（youthwill内页↑）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foogzhh8f_vAXA5WtBMXO1QGPFif.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（吴竹双头彩笔↑）</span></p>]]></description>
