  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 这是我相亲28次总结出的相亲指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648b13aeeedbb7b5edc6a776</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648b13aeeedbb7b5edc6a776</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Jun 2023 13:35:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎收听女子英专生的日常。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是一期延迟录制的520特辑，我们邀请了实战经验满分的小钢钢和爱情理论满分的昂叔一起聊聊相亲。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 大家的年龄以及接触相亲的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a>身边相亲成败比重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 吃瓜！我最爱听奇葩相亲故事啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 「一号瓜」相亲信息差：广撒网男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a>「二号瓜」控制成本：不喝星巴克男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a>「三号瓜」下头瞬间：greatful男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a>「四号瓜」下头瞬间：错别字男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a>「五号瓜」串台了吧：大姨夫的海鲜男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1716">28:36</a>「六号瓜」领导安排来的盲盒小哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>观点碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a> 相亲和爱情有什么区别？怎么定义相亲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2139">35:39</a> 正丨相亲中真的会遇到爱情吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 反丨相亲中的爱情可能是合理化！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 到了一个年龄真的就要相亲吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 相亲市场的性别：女性被物化了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">51:21</a> 相亲男女比和地域有关吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3371">56:11</a> 相亲市场外形有多重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">61:01</a> 因为过于看重理性标准，相亲的确更不真诚吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3785">63:05</a> 相亲的三种渠道形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> 如何更好地找到相亲对象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4271">71:11</a> 聊聊大家的理想恋爱状态</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqBdGSm8qvZLAf2UuApwH2-q98Z_.m4a" length="44305031" type="audio/mp4"/>
