  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 为什么要比较北上广深宜居程度啊！！说得好像我买得起房一样！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64285425fe1d67cb9dc64be3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64285425fe1d67cb9dc64be3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Apr 2023 15:56:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈罗大家好，欢迎收听女子英专生的日常！</span></p><span></span><p><span>都说生活在一线城市的我们是『悬浮在城市上空的一代』，你有这样的感觉嘛？刚巧冷月、阿多、左左和柚子我们四人分别生活在北上广深，跨越祖国的大江南北，本期我们一起来聊聊大家分别对这四个城市的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 灵魂拷问：为什么当初来这个城市？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 城市经济发展比较：我们可是有数据的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 房租比较：我是自愿交房租的（乖巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 日常开销：精打细算地保持冲动消费就是我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 买房，一个令人沉默的话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 落户与限行政策：舔与被舔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 工作机会VS城市特色工作种类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 生活便利程度：便利店地铁与咖啡厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a> 归属感：安全、方言与路人态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 医疗技术：从看病水平到人文关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 教育水平：从中学生到大学生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3906">01:05:06</a>城市底蕴：北上广深人设图鉴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4130">01:08:50</a> 图书馆与艺术展：哪个城市最文艺！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4803">01:20:03</a> 环境气候：四个城市空气大考量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5030">01:23:50</a> 总结｜走心环节：这个城市到底带给了你什么？</span></p>]]></description>
